      "statement": "CallbackManager and AsyncCallbackManager are the primary synchronous and asynchronous implementations of BaseCallbackManager that coordinate handler registration, dispatch events to handlers via handle_event/ahandle_event, and maintain inheritance hierarchies through inheritable_handlers, inheritable_tags, and inheritable_metadata that are passed to child operations.",
