      "id": "claim_08017b9db92e45d6a2d40e2b8be72987",
      "statement": "The handle_event function (synchronous) and ahandle_event function (asynchronous) are the core event dispatch mechanisms that check handler ignore_* properties to conditionally invoke event methods, handle exceptions respecting raise_error flags, implement on_chat_model_start fallback to on_llm_start for non-implementing handlers, and collect and execute async coroutines while preserving context variables.",
