      "statement": "Callback inheritance in handler hierarchies follows distinct rules: inheritable_handlers and inheritable_tags are accumulated through the operation tree, handlers and tags are operation-local, and inheritable_metadata is merged recursively, enabling global handlers (like LangSmith tracer) to be invoked for all descendant operations while supporting operation-specific handlers and tags.",
